### Step-by-Step Execution Guide

<Steps>
<Step subtitle="1 min" title="Commit Updated Files">
Commit both the updated `package.json` and `.github/workflows/build.yml` files directly to your main branch on GitHub.
*Verification:* The GitHub Actions tab automatically starts a new workflow run.
</Step>

<Step subtitle="1-2 min" title="Monitor the Workflow Run">
Navigate to the **Actions** tab in your repository and click on the active workflow run to watch its progress.
*Verification:* All steps complete successfully with green checkmarks.
</Step>

<Step subtitle="30 sec" title="Download and Launch App">
Scroll down to the **Artifacts** section of the completed run summary, download `LuxVM-Windows-App`, extract the archive, and double-click **luxvm-desktop.exe** inside the folder.
*Verification:* The LuxVM desktop application launches smoothly without errors.
</Step>
</Steps>

